# Held-out classes per LICENSING-MANIFEST.md — these live in the Claude Design
# studio (the re-obtain path) and are deliberately not tracked here. Patterns
# are anchored to this workspace root so future legitimate paths (for example
# docs/reference/ or a docs/HANDOFF.md) stay trackable.

# Re-include the reference components' AUTHORED declaration files: the root
# .gitignore ignores **/*.d.ts as build output, but these four are hand-written
# prop documentation from the design studio, not generated artefacts.
!components/**/*.d.ts

# Class 15 — studio provenance (screenshots, brand toolkit PDF, note sources,
# Figma dump, oak-components theme extracts)
/uploads/
/reference/

# Class 16 — studio infrastructure (generated bundles, thumbnails, compiler
# output, and the studio's own session/handoff surfaces). `.thumbnail` stays
# unanchored deliberately: every level's .thumbnail is a studio-generated
# preview artefact (templates/*/.thumbnail included).
/_ds_bundle.js
/_ds_manifest.json
/_adherence.oxlintrc.json
.thumbnail
/thumbnail.html
/support.js
/CLAUDE.md
/SKILL.md
/HANDOFF.md
/CLAUDE-CODE-HANDOFF.md
